{
  "version": 1,
  "readme": [
    "ae-dark — a dark, Autechre-ish patch grown from one seed (16902).",
    "",
    "The whole AE system, thinned out. `beat` is a markovseq that barely",
    "wanders: the chain plus three moments of doubt (a fold back at step 8, a",
    "stutter at 15, bar two skipping ahead) and no self-rewriting. It plays bd,",
    "crack, hats, an occasional sub and one Big Modal object (lead_thud). Its",
    "variation is small and constant: step probabilities, velocity and micro-",
    "timing slowly animating, one lurching pair of steps (1/16d + 1/32 —",
    "exactly two sixteenths, so the bar never drifts), hat rolls.",
    "",
    "`drift` is the dark half: a second sequencer on slower, uneven steps that",
    "rewrites itself every 64, feeding drone, metal (bass) and string — all",
    "snapped to A# aeolian. The crack and the object strike `atmo`, a Deep Pad",
    "tuned to the key; `tape` hums under it; both are ducked by the bass drum",
    "(breathe). `terra` moves one synth or effect param at a time, slowly; the",
    "jumpers throw an echo, a freeze or a drive change now and then.",
    "",
    "Every choice here — tempo, key, pattern, timbres, the object — came from",
    "seed 16902 — `.claude/tools/ae_dark.py <seed>` grows another (see\nribbit/docs/user/ae-machine.md).",
    "",
    "Try:",
    "  /start",
    "  /drone mute /metal mute /string mute   just the beat",
    "  /beat animate=none            freeze the beat's variations where they are",
    "  /beat prob=100                every step, no gaps",
    "  /jumpers dice=15              more happens to the effects",
    "  /object preset=anti_wood_plank",
    "  /harmony tuning=et19          the synths go microtonal, the drums don't care",
    "  /notverb freeze=on            hold the room; /notverb freeze=off",
    "  /tape stop                    the pad fades over its release"
  ],
